resolution: Focused module ownership is established; the governed LAN service is the real default; all large machine output flushes safely; SDK/CLI compatibility remains complete.
expected_result: Command/storage boundaries are explicit and every installed CLI programmatic workflow remains valid against the configured local SearXNG service.
actual_result: "New lifecycle/files modules, LAN default contracts, safe 67 KB instance JSON piping, 933 tests at 100/100/100/100, release:check, and npm-global jq/TOON black-box validation all pass."
